Table full name: TCGA_HG38_DATA_V0.QOTM._1000GENOMES
Column name: names Type: VARIANT Description: Alternate base.
Column name: CIPOS Type: VARIANT Description: List of failed filters (if any) or PASS indicating the variant has passed all filters.
Column name: start_position Type: NUMBER Description: Start position (0-based). Corresponds to the first base of the string of reference bases.
Column name: call Type: VARIANT Description: Variant names (e.g. RefSNP ID).
Column name: reference_name Type: TEXT Description: Reference name.
Column name: CIEND Type: VARIANT Description: Phred-scaled quality score (-10log10 prob(call is wrong)). Higher values imply better quality.
Column name: SVLEN Type: VARIANT Description: Name of the call.
Column name: AN Type: NUMBER Description: Confidence interval around END for imprecise variants
Column name: quality Type: FLOAT Description: Total number of alternate alleles in called genotypes
Column name: alternate_bases Type: VARIANT Description: One record for each alternate base (if any).
Column name: end_position Type: NUMBER Description: End position, in 1-based integer coordinates
Column name: filter Type: VARIANT Description: Estimated allele frequency in the range (0,1)
Column name: IMPRECISE Type: BOOLEAN Description: One record for each call.
Column name: SVTYPE Type: TEXT Description: Genotype of the call "-1" is used in cases where the genotype is not called.
Column name: reference_bases Type: TEXT Description: Reference bases.
Column name: NS Type: NUMBER Description: Phaseset of the call (if any). "*" is used in cases where the genotype is phased, but no phase set ("PS" in FORMAT) was specified.
