Table full name: TCGA_HG38_DATA_V0.TCGA_BIOCLIN_V0.ANNOTATIONS
Column name: date_created Type: TEXT Description: Date on which this annotation was originally created; includes time-stamp and time-zone, eg 2011-03-14T18:00:42-04:00  --  dates range between March 2009 and June 2016
Column name: case_barcode Type: TEXT Description: TCGA patient/case barcode; e.g. TCGA-06-0119
Column name: entity_type Type: TEXT Description: Type of the entity that this annotation applies to; e.g. Shipped Portion, Aliquot, Patient (which has the same meaning as Case), Analyte, etc.
Column name: notes Type: TEXT Description: Longer descriptive text about this annotation
Column name: category Type: TEXT Description: Annotation category; one of a relatively short list of phrases from a controlled-vocabulary; e.g. Item is noncanonical, Item flagged DNU, Prior malignancy, etc.
Column name: entity_barcode Type: TEXT Description: Barcode of the entity that this annotation applies to; often the same as the case barcode
Column name: sample_barcode Type: TEXT Description: TCGA sample barcode; e.g. TCGA-06-0119-01A (note that this field will be null if the annotation applies at a higher level than sample)
Column name: project_short_name Type: TEXT Description: Project name abbreviation; the program name appended with a project name abbreviation; e.g. TCGA-OV, etc.
Column name: aliquot_barcode Type: TEXT Description: TCGA aliquot barcode; e.g. TCGA-06-0119-01A-08D-0216-06 (note that this field will be null if the annotation applies at a higher level than aliquot)
Column name: case_gdc_id Type: TEXT Description: GDC case identifier for the patient/case associated with this specific annotation
Column name: classification Type: TEXT Description: Annotation classification; e.g. Notification, CenterNotification, Observation, or Redaction
Column name: date_edited Type: TEXT Description: Annotations were rarely edited, but if thery were (fewer than 10 out of over 6000 total annotations), this field indicates the date on which it was edited
