Table full name: TCGA_HG38_DATA_V0.TCGA_HG38_DATA_V0.DNA_METHYLATION_CHR13
Column name: sample_gdc_id Type: TEXT
Column name: aliquot_gdc_id Type: TEXT
Column name: aliquot_barcode Type: TEXT Description: Original TCGA aliquot barcode, eg TCGA-12-1089-01A-01D-0517-01
Column name: sample_barcode Type: TEXT Description: Original TCGA sample barcode, eg TCGA-12-1089-01A  --  note that one sample may have multiple aliquots and therefore multiple sets of CN segmentations; so be sure to use GROUP BY appropriately in your queries
Column name: case_barcode Type: TEXT Description: Original TCGA case barcode, eg TCGA-12-1089  --  note that each case typically has a primary-tumor sample and a matched-normal (blood or adjacent tissue) sample; please refer to the TCGA Biospecimen table for more details
Column name: beta_value Type: FLOAT Description: Normalized DNA methylation beta value (between 0 and 1, where 0 indicates completely un-methylated and 1 indicates fully methylated)
Column name: probe_id Type: TEXT Description: Unique probe identifier (eg cg04676771) from the Illumina Human Methylation array -- please refer to the annotation table (isb-cgc:platform_reference.methylation_annotation) for more details about any particular probe
Column name: file_gdc_id Type: TEXT
Column name: case_gdc_id Type: TEXT
Column name: platform Type: TEXT Description: Platform name used to generate this data -- either HumanMethylation450 or HumanMethylation27
