Table full name: TCGA_HG38_DATA_V0.TCGA_HG38_DATA_V0.TCGA_METADATA_DATA_HG38_R14
Column name: type Type: TEXT Description: Description of the data, eg. clinical_supplement, aligned_reads
Column name: project_short_name Type: TEXT Description: Project name abbreviation; the program name appended with a project name abbreviation; eg. TCGA-OV, etc.
Column name: disease_code Type: TEXT Description: A code representing the type of cancer. Values can be found at https://gdc.cancer.gov/resources-TCGA-users/TCGA-code-tables/TCGA-study-abbreviations; eg. OV, GBM, LUAD
Column name: index_file_name_key Type: TEXT Description: GDC path to original vcf or bam index file 
Column name: access Type: TEXT Description: Data accessibility policy (open or controlled)
Column name: experimental_strategy Type: TEXT Description: Experimental strategy used to generate data (where applicable) e.g. WXS, RNA-Seq
Column name: program_name Type: TEXT Description: Program name, eg TCGA or TARGET
Column name: sample_gdc_id Type: TEXT Description: Unique GDC identifier for this sample (corresponds to the sample_barcode), eg a1ec9279-c1a6-4e58-97ed-9ec1f36187c5  --  this can be used to access more information from the GDC data portal
Column name: platform Type: TEXT Description: Platform used to generate data (null, Illumina)
Column name: case_gdc_id Type: TEXT Description: Unique GDC identifier for this case (corresponds to the case_barcode).  Can be used to access more information from the GDC data portal like this:   https://portal.gdc.cancer.gov/files/c21b332c-06c6-4403-9032-f91c8f407ba37
Column name: file_size Type: NUMBER Description: The size of the file measured in bytes
Column name: index_file_id Type: TEXT Description: BAM  or VCF index file GDC file UUID
Column name: data_category Type: TEXT Description: Category description of the underlying data, eg Clinical, Raw Sequencing Data, Simple Nucleotide Variation, Transcriptome Profiling  , etc
Column name: index_file_size Type: NUMBER Description: When available, the size of the file measured in bytes
Column name: data_format Type: TEXT Description: File format of the underlying data, eg BCR XML, BAM
Column name: acl Type: TEXT Description: Access Control List -- if access is controlled, this field contains the dbGaP accession, eg phs000179
Column name: sample_barcode Type: TEXT Description: TCGA sample barcode, eg TCGA-12-1089-01A. One sample may have multiple sets of CN segmentations corresponding to multiple aliquots; use GROUP BY appropriately in queries
Column name: case_barcode Type: TEXT Description: Original TCGA case barcode, eg TCGA-DX-A8BN
Column name: file_name_key Type: TEXT Description: GDC path to original bam or vcf file
Column name: file_gdc_id Type: TEXT Description: Unique GDC identifier for this file (corresponds to the file_barcode)  --  this can be used to access more information from the GDC data portal like this: https://portal.gdc.cancer.gov/files/c21b332c-06c6-4403-9032-f91c8f407ba44
Column name: data_type Type: TEXT Description: Experimental source of the data type, eg Tissue slide image, RNA-Seq
