Table full name: TCGA_HG38_DATA_V0.TCGA_HG38_DATA_V0.MIRNASEQ_ISOFORM_EXPRESSION
Column name: cross_mapped Type: TEXT Description: A short isomiR read may map exactly to mature strands whose sequences are similar but not identical, when the read sequence does not capture the bases that distinguish these miRNAs (e.g. hsa-mir-30a at 6q13 and hsa-mir-30e at 1p34.2, which differ at position 18). We report such a <line_feed> read as cross-mapped, and we increment the read count for each MIMAT that it mapped to. Either Y or N -- fewer than 2% are Y
Column name: mirna_accession Type: TEXT Description: One of 2459 unique mature miRNA accession id (eg MIMAT0000062) -- note that this can also be null, in the event that this read does not map to a mature portion of the miRNA
Column name: case_barcode Type: TEXT Description: Original TCGA case barcode, eg TCGA-12-1089  --  note that each case typically has a primary-tumor sample and a matched-normal (blood or adjacent tissue) sample; please refer to the TCGA Biospecimen table for more details
Column name: reads_per_million_miRNA_mapped Type: FLOAT Description: Read count normalized by total reads mapped divided by 1 million
Column name: aliquot_barcode Type: TEXT Description: Original TCGA aliquot barcode, eg TCGA-12-1089-01A-01D-0517-01
Column name: read_count Type: NUMBER Description: Number of reads that were mapped to this mirna_id
Column name: chromosome Type: TEXT Description: Chromosome, possible values: chr1-22, and chrX
Column name: strand Type: TEXT Description: Either + or - to denote whether read mapped to the sense (+) or anti-sense (-) strand
Column name: start_pos Type: NUMBER Description: 1-based start chromosome position of isoform
Column name: mirna_id Type: TEXT Description: One of 1788 unique miRNA ids (aka symbols) contained in this table, eg hsa-mir-21
Column name: mirna_transcript Type: TEXT Description: Indicates the type of transcript -- either mature, precursor, unannotated, or stemloop  (if this value is not mature, then the mirna_accession field will be null)
Column name: sample_barcode Type: TEXT Description: Original TCGA sample barcode, eg TCGA-12-1089-01A
Column name: end_pos Type: NUMBER Description: 1-based end chromosome position of isoform
Column name: project_short_name Type: TEXT Description: Project name abbreviation; the program name appended with a project name abbreviation; eg. TCGA-OV, etc.
Sample rows:
